</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Add the Koss Sauce,&nbsp;the can of baked beans and mix well. Allow the beef and bean mixture to heat through. (about 5 minutes)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Spray a large deep casserole dish with spray oil then pour the hot beef and bean mixture into the dish and top with the biscuits as illustrated above, cutting them in half and arranging them around the top in a ring evenly.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Top the biscuits with the shredded cheese and bake for 35 minutes at 350 degrees.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Remove the casserole from the oven and tap the biscuits. They should sound hollow and not look doughy around the edges.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Lightly mist the top of the biscuits with spray olive oil and garnish with chopped parsley to serve.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Enjoy!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lo1v077x":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-lo1v077x","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-jpud7xd8":{"id":"comp-jpud7xd8","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App","generalErrorPrefix":"Try again later, disable any ad blockers, or reload the page. Contact the author of","generalErrorSuffix":"for 